{
  "@context": {
    "schema": "https://schema.org/"
  },
  "@type": "Note",
  "@id": "note:notion-31",
  "title": "Concisionism: A Framework",
  "author": "person:jane-brew:001",
  "status": "draft",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b-1",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 1,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Concisionism: A Framework"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-2",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Creating a system to organize your thoughts into blog posts involves blending structure with creativity. Here’s a breakdown:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-3",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**1. Define Your Core Themes**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-6",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-4",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Purpose**: Anchor your blog posts to recurring themes or areas of expertise."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-5",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Action**: Identify 3–5 overarching themes (e.g., philosophy, entrepreneurship, personal growth)."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-7",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Example: \"Exploring the intersection of technology and ethics\" or \"Minimalism in creativity and life.\""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-8",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**2. Develop a Thought Funnel Framework**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-11",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-9",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Purpose**: Funnel raw ideas into polished blog posts through a repeatable structure."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-10",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Action**: Create these stages for your system:"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-12",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- **Capture**: A frictionless way to collect ideas as they come (e.g., voice notes, a note-taking app like Notion, or a physical notebook)."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-13",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- **Refine**: Periodically review your raw ideas. Ask:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-14",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Does this align with my themes?"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-15",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Is there a fresh angle or personal experience tied to it?"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-16",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- **Outline**: Turn ideas into outlines with key points (more on this below)."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-17",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- **Expand**: Write drafts based on your outlines."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-18",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- **Polish**: Edit drafts with attention to clarity and style."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-19",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**3. Use a Question-Based Framework**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-22",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-20",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Purpose**: To ensure depth and purpose in every blog post."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-21",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Action**: For each idea, answer these:"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-23",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "1. **Why does this matter?** (Purpose)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-24",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "2. **What is the key insight?** (Thesis or main argument)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-25",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "3. **Who will this benefit?** (Audience)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-26",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "4. **How can I make this actionable or thought-provoking?** (Practical steps or reflection points)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-27",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**4. Set Up a Thought Bank**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-30",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-28",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Purpose**: Maintain a repository of ideas to avoid starting from scratch."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-29",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Action**: Use a tool like Notion, Roam Research, or Obsidian. Categorize ideas by:"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-31",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- **Themes** (e.g., \"Entrepreneurial Reflections\")"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-32",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- **Stages** (e.g., Captured, Refined, Outlined)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-33",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- **Tags** (e.g., storytelling, practical advice, personal anecdotes)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-34",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**5. Build a Writing Habit**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-37",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-35",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Purpose**: Convert ideas into consistent output."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-36",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Action**:"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-38",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- **Timebox**: Dedicate a fixed amount of time daily or weekly to each stage of the funnel."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-39",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Example: Mondays for outlining, Wednesdays for drafting, Fridays for polishing."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-40",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- **Set Deadlines**: Even for self-published posts, treat deadlines seriously."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-41",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**6. Create an Outline Template**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-44",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-42",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Purpose**: Simplify the transition from idea to blog post."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-43",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Template Example**:"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-45",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "1. **Hook**: A compelling question, quote, or anecdote."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-46",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "2. **Context**: Why this topic matters."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-47",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "3. **Thesis**: One sentence summing up your main argument or insight."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-48",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "4. **Body**:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-49",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Point 1: Explain + example."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-50",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Point 2: Explain + example."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-51",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Point 3: Explain + example."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-52",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "5. **Conclusion**:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-53",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Summarize the main point."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-54",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Offer a takeaway or call to action."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-55",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**7. Include Reflection and Iteration**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-58",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-56",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Purpose**: Ensure quality and originality."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-57",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Action**:"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-59",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- After publishing, revisit your blog post after a week. Reflect:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-60",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Did it achieve its purpose?"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-61",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- How was it received?"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-62",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- How could it be improved?"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-63",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Use insights to refine your system."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-64",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**8. Lean into Tools**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-67",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-65",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Purpose**: Streamline and systematize."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-66",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Action**:"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-68",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- **Capture**: Apps like Evernote, Notion, or Google Keep."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-69",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- **Organize**: Use folders or tags for stages/themes."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-70",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- **Write**: Tools like Scrivener or Google Docs."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-71",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- **Edit**: Use Grammarly or Hemingway for polishing."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-72",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**9. Emphasize Simplicity**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-75",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-73",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Purpose**: Avoid over-complication and friction."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-74",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Action**: Focus on building momentum. Avoid letting perfectionism stall the process."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-76",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Example Workflow in Practice:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-77",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "1. **Idea**: \"How Minimalism Fuels Creativity.\""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-78",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "2. **Captured**: \"Saw a minimalist art exhibit—felt energized.\""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-79",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "3. **Refined**: \"Link minimalism in art to decision fatigue in creativity.\""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-80",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "4. **Outline**:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-81",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Hook: \"Why do less often lead to more in creativity?\""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-82",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Body:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-83",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Decision fatigue and clutter."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-84",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Examples of minimalist creators (e.g., Steve Jobs)."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-85",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Practical ways to adopt minimalist practices."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-86",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Conclusion: \"Creativity flourishes when we make space for it.\""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-87",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "5. **Draft**: Write."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-88",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "6. **Polish**: Edit."
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}